{"reviewId": "9808286_7Xt8gfVtw", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "总结来说，康波的顶就是繁荣的开始，康波的谷指的繁荣的结束。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2120", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "9808286_7Xt8gfVtw", "userVid": 9808286, "topics": [], "createTime": 1737810778, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 9808286, "name": "七月在野", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0011-I73zyGFWxFHghYXssLNkh10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "七月在野", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "谦光逼人", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20251013-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 256832302, "name": "🍀西天取经的无尾鱼", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-HjDB6BuooO4FNjlckCLHMe3/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "🍀西天取经的无尾鱼", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "只吃微微辣的重庆妹子", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241021-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "感觉说反了呢", "reviewId": "9808286_7Xt8gfVtw", "commentId": "9808286_7Xt8gfVtw_c30722454_83Z0zBGqv", "userVid": 30722454, "createTime": 1760751029, "author": {"userVid": 30722454, "name": "莘", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.